\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +8%</a>:</b> +8% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dodge.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +4</a>:</b> Provides a +4 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">competence bonus</a> to your <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\"> Diversion 20% (Insight)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\"> Diversion 20% (Insight)</a>:</b> This item reduces the threat generated by melee damage by 20%.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Wolf.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Wolf.png/420px-Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Wolf.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"341\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Wolf.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>The interior of this cloak is reinforced with a lightweight chainmail mesh, providing extra protection while retaining ease of movement.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817200122\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.151 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3087/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21500/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5981/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n165.37%  212.763     43 Template:IO\n100.00%  128.660      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  128.660      1 -total\n 96.56%  124.230      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 55.15%   70.956      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 54.30%   69.856      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 53.47%   68.792      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 52.59%   67.668      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.99%   23.150      6 Template:Popup\n 13.62%   17.524      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache: